  "数据源": "Data Source",
  "显示在选择器、工具栏和卡片文件名中；粘贴 URL 时自动取域名，可改。": "Shown in pickers, the toolbar, and card file names; auto-filled with the pasted URL's domain — edit as needed.",
  "如：我的行情源": "e.g. My Quote Source",
  "如：金融卡片/自定义": "e.g. Finance Cards/Custom",
  "配置": "Setup",
  "字段映射（可选）": "Field Mapping (optional)",
  "K线接口地址": "K-line Endpoint URL",
  "粘贴一个能直接访问的完整 URL（带真实代码与日期），插件会自动识别代码与日期并生成模板、自动检测数据格式。": "Paste a complete, working URL (with a real code and dates); the plugin detects the code and dates, builds the template, and tests the data format for you.",
  "粘贴 URL 后将自动检测接口与数据格式。": "Paste a URL; the endpoint and its data format are detected automatically.",
  "示例代码": "Sample Code",
  "URL 中实际使用的代码，用于识别 {code} 位置并作为接口检测代码；URL 不含代码的固定报表类接口可留空。支持复合代码「URL部分@映射列名」（如 REPORT_NAME@COL_NAME）：URL 中的 {code} 用前半部分填充，字段映射中的 {code} 用后半部分选列。": "The code actually used in the URL — locates the {code} placeholder and serves as the test code; leave empty for fixed-report URLs without a code. Supports composite codes \"URL-part@column-name\" (e.g. REPORT_NAME@COL_NAME): the first part fills {code} in the URL, the second fills {code} in the field mapping to pick a column.",
  "自动生成的模板": "Generated template",
  "高级选项": "Advanced Options",
  "一般无需改动：接口多为 GET 请求；示例代码会自动从 URL 猜测；鉴权 Header、搜索接口与静态代码表按需配置。": "Usually no changes needed: most endpoints are plain GET; the sample code is auto-guessed from the URL; configure the auth header, search endpoint, and static code table only as needed.",
  "搜索 URL（可选）": "Search URL (optional)",
  "API Key（可选）": "API Key (optional)",
  "接口要求密钥时填写，URL 模板中用 {apiKey} 占位引用。密钥只存在本地设置里，导出配置时不会包含。": "Fill in when the endpoint requires a key; reference it in the URL template with the {apiKey} placeholder. The key is stored only in local settings and is never included in exported configs.",
  "粘贴 URL 时自动抽取，也可手动填写": "Auto-extracted from a pasted URL, or enter manually",
  "鉴权 Header（可选）": "Auth Header (optional)",
  "接口要求密钥放在请求头时填写：只写「Header名」表示值为 API Key 本身；「Header名: 值模板」中可用 {apiKey} 占位。": "Fill in when the endpoint expects the key in a request header: a bare \"Header name\" sends the API key as the value; \"Header name: value template\" supports the {apiKey} placeholder.",
  "请求方式": "Request Method",
  "GET 把参数放在 URL 查询串中；POST 把下方请求体模板作为 JSON 请求体发送（自动带 Content-Type: application/json）。": "GET puts the parameters in the URL query; POST sends the body template below as a JSON request body (Content-Type: application/json is added automatically).",
  "请求体模板": "Request Body Template",
  "POST 请求体，与 URL 使用同一套占位符：{code} {start} {end} {startIso} {endIso} {apiKey}。": "The POST request body; supports the same placeholders as the URL: {code} {start} {end} {startIso} {endIso} {apiKey}.",
  "兼容模式（Node https）": "Compatibility Mode (Node https)",
  "个别站点（如 api.stlouisfed.org）在 Obsidian 默认网络栈下连接失败时开启；请求改用 Node https（HTTP/1.1）发送。": "Enable when a host (e.g. api.stlouisfed.org) fails to connect under Obsidian's default network stack; requests are then sent via Node https (HTTP/1.1).",
  "检测到 HTTP/2 协议错误：该站点可能不兼容 Obsidian 默认网络栈，可在「高级选项」中开启兼容模式（node 传输）后重试。": "HTTP/2 protocol error detected: this host may be incompatible with Obsidian's default network stack — enable compatibility mode (node transport) under \"Advanced Options\" and retry.",
  "该源属组「{group}」：密钥留空时自动使用组内第一个已填写的密钥。": "This source belongs to group \"{group}\": leave the key empty to automatically use the first key filled in within the group.",
  "列名数组": "column names",
  "粘贴一个带搜索词的完整搜索 URL，插件会自动将搜索词替换为 {query}；搜索接口为 POST 时留空、改填下方搜索请求体；都不配则该源使用手工录入代码。": "Paste a complete search URL including a keyword; the plugin replaces the keyword with {query}. Leave empty and fill in the search body below when the search endpoint is POST; with neither, codes are entered manually for this source.",
  "搜索请求体（POST，可选）": "Search Body (POST, optional)",
  "搜索接口为 POST 时填写，可用 {query}、{apiKey} 占位。配置后搜索走 POST，URL 取上方「搜索 URL」，留空则复用 K线 URL。模板不含 {query} 表示接口只能整表返回，插件会拉回后按关键词本地过滤（结果有缓存）。": "Fill in when the search endpoint is POST; supports the {query} and {apiKey} placeholders. Once set, search goes POST to the \"Search URL\" above, falling back to the K-line URL. A template without {query} means the endpoint only returns the whole list — the plugin fetches it and filters locally by keyword (results are cached).",
  "搜索模板不含 {query}：搜索时整表拉回，由插件按关键词本地过滤。": "The search template has no {query}: the whole list is fetched and filtered locally by keyword.",
  "搜索 URL 未配置，POST 搜索将复用 K线 URL。": "No search URL configured; the POST search reuses the K-line URL.",
  "未识别到搜索词参数，请手动把 URL 中的搜索词替换为 {query}。": "No keyword parameter recognized; replace the keyword in the URL with {query} manually.",
  "检测连接": "Test Connection",
  "复制报错（发给 AI）": "Copy Error Report (for your AI)",
  "报错与调试信息已复制，去发给你的 AI 吧。": "Error report and debug info copied — send it to your AI.",
  "正在检测接口…": "Testing the endpoint…",
