  // ===== AI 辅助 (settings tab: MCP / CLI for external agents) =====
  "本插件不内置 AI 助手，由你自己的 AI agent（Codex、Claude Code 等）配合提示词操作插件。流程：先接入 AI（只需一次），之后按场景复制对应提示词发给它。":
    "This plugin has no built-in AI assistant — your own AI agent (Codex, Claude Code, etc.) drives the plugin with the prompts below. Flow: connect your AI first (once), then copy the prompt matching your scenario and send it to the AI.",
  "接入你的 AI（MCP / CLI，只需一次）": "Connect your AI (MCP / CLI, one-time)",
  "最省事的方式：复制「一键配置提示词」发给你的 AI agent，它会自动定位 vault 路径并完成注册；下方配置片段供手动配置，把 <vault路径> 换成你的 vault 根目录。":
    "Easiest way: copy the \"one-click setup prompt\" below and send it to your AI agent — it locates the vault path itself and finishes the registration; the config snippets below are for manual setup (replace <vault路径> with your vault root).",
  "一键配置提示词（复制给你的 AI）": "One-click setup prompt (copy for your AI)",
  "请帮我把 Obsidian 插件 StrataBoard 的 MCP server 配置好，之后你就可以直接调用它的工具了。\n\n背景：StrataBoard 是一个 Obsidian 金融数据卡片插件，附带一个 MCP stdio server（需要 Node 18+），入口文件是 <vault根目录>/.obsidian/plugins/strataboard/mcp-server.js。它提供这些工具：search_symbols / list_sources / validate_cards / probe_data / get_card_guide。\n\n请按以下步骤操作：\n1. 确定我的 vault 根目录：如果当前工作目录在某个 Obsidian vault 内（向上查找包含 .obsidian 目录的位置）就直接用它；找不到就问我，不要猜。\n2. 按你的客户端注册名为 strataboard 的 MCP server：command 为 node，args 为 [\"<vault根目录>/.obsidian/plugins/strataboard/mcp-server.js\", \"--vault\", \"<vault根目录>\"]（也可以用环境变量 STRATABOARD_VAULT 传 vault 路径）。\n   - Codex：写入 ~/.codex/config.toml 的 [mcp_servers.strataboard]；\n   - Claude Code：执行 claude mcp add，或编辑对应的配置文件；\n   - 其它客户端：用它自己的 MCP 配置方式写入等价的 JSON。\n3. 写完后把最终配置内容给我看一遍，并告诉我是否需要重启或重载客户端才能生效。\n4. 如果 MCP 始终不可用，改用插件附带的 CLI：node \"<vault根目录>/.obsidian/plugins/strataboard/cli.js\" <命令> --vault \"<vault根目录>\"，命令有 search / sources / validate / probe。\n\n用我使用的语言与我交流，遇到拿不准的地方先问我再动手。":
    "Please set up the MCP server of the Obsidian plugin StrataBoard for me, so you can call its tools directly from now on.\n\nBackground: StrataBoard is an Obsidian financial-data card plugin that ships an MCP stdio server (requires Node 18+); the entry file is <vault root>/.obsidian/plugins/strataboard/mcp-server.js. It provides these tools: search_symbols / list_sources / validate_cards / probe_data / get_card_guide.\n\nPlease follow these steps:\n1. Determine my vault root: if the current working directory is inside an Obsidian vault (walk up until you find a directory containing .obsidian), use it directly; if you can't find one, ask me — do not guess.\n2. Register an MCP server named strataboard in your client: command is node, args are [\"<vault root>/.obsidian/plugins/strataboard/mcp-server.js\", \"--vault\", \"<vault root>\"] (you may also pass the vault path via the STRATABOARD_VAULT environment variable).\n   - Codex: write the [mcp_servers.strataboard] section of ~/.codex/config.toml;\n   - Claude Code: run claude mcp add, or edit the corresponding config file;\n   - other clients: write the equivalent JSON using their own MCP configuration mechanism.\n3. When done, show me the final config content and tell me whether the client needs a restart or reload for it to take effect.\n4. If MCP never works, fall back to the bundled CLI: node \"<vault root>/.obsidian/plugins/strataboard/cli.js\" <command> --vault \"<vault root>\", with commands search / sources / validate / probe.\n\nCommunicate in the language I use, and ask me before acting whenever you are unsure.",
  "Codex（~/.codex/config.toml）": "Codex (~/.codex/config.toml)",
  "其他 agent（Claude Code 等，JSON 配置）": "Other agents (Claude Code etc., JSON config)",
  "提供工具：search_symbols / list_sources / validate_cards / probe_data / get_card_guide。":
    "Tools: search_symbols / list_sources / validate_cards / probe_data / get_card_guide.",
  "CLI 命令（MCP 不可用时的替代）": "CLI commands (fallback when MCP is unavailable)",
  "所有命令输出 JSON，适合脚本与 agent 调用；--vault 缺省时读环境变量 STRATABOARD_VAULT，再从当前目录向上查找含 .obsidian 的目录。":
    "Every command prints JSON, suitable for scripts and agents; without --vault it reads the STRATABOARD_VAULT env var, then walks up from the cwd looking for a directory containing .obsidian.",
